WEBVTT

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.300
Still no answer, sir.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:29.160
Keep it open. I don't like any of that.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:35.920
Since the first contact, Scott and Sulu should have contacted us again half an hour ago.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.480
Maybe they have nothing to report.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.960
Our sensors indicate that there is no way of life except the descent group.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.000
Both know the descent group's procedures.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.690
They should have contacted us.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.290
Contact established.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:49.160
Jackson, Enterprise.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.660
Enterprise, this is Kirk.

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.170
One to climb, Enterprise.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.820
One?

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.170
Jackson, where are Scott and Sulu?

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:58.670
I'm ready to climb, sir.

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:00.000
Jackson!

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:02.570
Sorry, I can not improve, Captain.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.770
Notify the transport room to transport the member of the descent group.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:08.030
And call the doctor to the transport room immediately.

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:08.870
Yes, sir.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:18.920
Activate.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:22.340
What is it, Jim?

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:23.170
Problems.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.400
Jackson, where are the others?

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:50.570
Captain Kirk, can you hear me?

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:53.700
There is a curse in your ship.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:59.730
Leave this place, or all of you will die.

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:11.650
space.

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:13.120
The final frontier.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:20.360
These are the trips of the star ship Enterprise in its five-year mission to explore

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:25.970
new worlds, to search for new lives, new civilizations.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:29.890
Audaciously going where no man has ever been.

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:41.680
Distribution Network: Journey to the Stars, the series.

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:12.750
Today's episode: "The Day of the Witches", Brazilian version, VTI Rio.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:16.800
D-day, star date 3018.2.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:20.230
The pilot Jackson is dead and there are no apparent physical causes.

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:24.170
Mr. Scott and Mr. Sulu remain out of contact on the planet below.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:30.000
Leaving the chief of assistant engineering, De Salle, in command of the Enterprise, I'm going down to the surface of the planet

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:34.680
To find my lost crew and find out what killed Jackson.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:45.380
The instruments did not indicate this fog.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:49.810
Without cloud formation, without water bodies, no temperature change.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:52.920
Under these conditions, fog is very difficult, Captain.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:59.320
According to our transport coordinates, this is the exact place where Jackson went back to the ship.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:27.020
- Reading, Mr. Spock. - No indication of...

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:30.000
One moment. Capturing reading.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:36.110
24.7 degrees, 137.16 meters away.

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:38.330
Multiple readings, Captain.

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:39.360
Scott Sulu?

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.370
Kierkegaard Enterprise.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:43.290
Enterprise, this is Lieutenant Uhura.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:47.920
What are the readings of the sensors on the ship now?

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.250
Report, sir.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.540
Only, Captain, the physical pulse of three of them.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:57.620
As much as the instruments can say, there is nothing alive down there.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:00.000
Lieutenant.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.670
Captain, we are only recording you.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:10.510
Captain? Captain Kirk?

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.900
Lieutenant, can you hear me?

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:24.780
Whatever it is, it's getting rough.

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:26.730
Do you think it has anything to do with the Interference?

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:30.000
I don't know. There must be some explanation.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:37.390
The fact that NASA's sensors only record us, while we have multiple readings of life forms, are they the lesson there, Spock?

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:41.460
No change, gentlemen.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:46.760
Keep the sir alert.

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:56.500
Oz, what do you think of this?

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:30.000
Who are you?

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:22.570
very bad captain a more useful comment Mr. Spock what we have just seen

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:30.000
it was not real this is useful however in azimuth 24

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.000
A little over 100 meters from here, there are definitely lifestyles.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:37.200
Erratic, confusing, but definitely recording.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.520
That's where we're going.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:11.560
That was a very real illusion, Mr. Spock.

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:57.540
It is the source of life-form readings, they are in there, somewhere.

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:07.760
- Enterprise, answer me. - Wasn't that how we lost contact with the landing group?

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:12.920
What do you think of this, Spock? Does this structure have anything to do with interference in communications?

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:17.860
I would say no, Captain. There is no indication that something could cause this interference.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:21.870
And that didn't appear in the ship's sensors?

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:25.010
Neither the sensors recorded the life forms inside it.

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:30.000
Could there be some kind of force field that cuts our sensor locks?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:39.060
- Would that affect Spock's tricorder too? - It would. I don't know.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:38.840
Three witches. What seems to be a castle and a black cat.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:45.130
If we didn't have two officers lost and a third dead, I would say that someone is trying to play ghosts with us.

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:49.900
- Ghosts, Captain? - Yes, Mr. Spock.

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:52.640
You're supernatural. I'll explain it any day.

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:55.290
- Let's take a look? - That seems to be the right one.

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.140
- Magro. - Spock.

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:10.190
They disappeared, Mr. Dessal.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:18.740
The captain and the others just stopped recording.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.820
Check and malfunction.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.800
I already did, sir. That's how it happened.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:30.000
Mr. Dessal, that's exactly what happened to Mr. Scott and his group. They...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.190
- They all disappeared. - No one simply disappeared.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:36.600
They may have found a magnetic field or some other type of obstruction.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:38.930
Mr. Chekov, recalibrate your sensors.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:41.420
- If you need help... - I'll do it, sir.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:43.030
I'm not such a novice.

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:48.700
Lieutenant Hura, continue your efforts to cross the static interference.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:52.370
- Not you, sir. - We know they're down there.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.630
Let's find them.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:06.820
- Forward, Mr. Spock. - The readings indicate so.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:37.750
The day of witches is like this.

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:22.770
- Spock, are you all right? - Yes, I'm not hurt, Captain.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:26.310
- Magro. - Doctor.

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:30.000
You were talking about Fantastic.

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:45.840
Tremors, curses, chained skeletons, these are terrestrial manifestations, why?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:52.850
I don't know Captain, but these things do exist, they are real.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:56.510
This could be a parallel development to Earth?

00:13:56.510 --> 00:13:59.350
None of this follows human development.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.880
It seems more like a human nightmare.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:11.400
As if someone knew what would scare another man at an unconscious level.

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:16.160
Ghosts, ogres, demons, everything.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.850
- Scott! - Sulu!

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:54.580
- Scott, put down the phaser. - Scott!

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:03.040
They look like they're drugged, Jim.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:06.390
Look at their eyes. They don't even blink.

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:09.510
Just like Jackson, before he died.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:15.680
But these two are alive. Scott, can you hear me?

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:19.970
Sulu, do you know who I am?

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:27.320
What happened?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.320
They're going to free us.

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:52.720
Whoever he is, he has proven his abilities in creating illusions, now I want to know why, and what did he do to my men?

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:58.600
Where did your race get this ridiculous predilection for resistance, huh?

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.920
Do you examine...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.460
In each object you question everything.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:05.620
It's not enough to accept what it is.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:09.420
Not when one of my men is dead because of it and the other two transformed into zombies.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:14.580
Not zombies. These two are merely controlled, Captain Kirk.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.560
Yes, we know who you are.

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:18.640
All of you.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:26.370
Isn't it, my dear?

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.240
You.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.000
Why did you bring us here?

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:36.840
My name is Korob. And when I brought them here, it was you who, on the contrary, insisted on coming.

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:39.480
I was warned to retreat.

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:41.580
Why?

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.300
What's the reason?

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:45.800
Why all this abracadabra?

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:47.410
Abracadabra?

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:56.790
Oh no, I assure you that's not it, Captain.

00:17:56.790 --> 00:18:00.000
Geographic expeditions mapped this solar system before.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:03.010
Never heard of life in Paris 7.

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:08.570
It is not important that we are not natives of this planet.

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:19.060
I was told that I was not a good host.

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:22.080
Gentlemen, would you accompany me in something to refresh?

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:32.790
- That cat. - That cat.

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:37.110
There are ancient terrestrial legends about sorcerers and their relatives.

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:42.590
- Relatives? - Demons in animal shapes sent by the devil to serve the sorcerer.

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:49.330
- Superstition? - I did not create the legend, Captain. I only reported it.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:54.680
You are the different, Mr. Spock. You do not think like the others.

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:59.790
There are no colors in your logic pattern. There is only black and white.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:05.760
You see all this around you, and yet you don't believe it.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.730
He doesn't know anything about ghosts.

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:10.390
I didn't understand that reference.

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:13.670
However, it's also not important.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:18.310
Gentlemen, I can be very hospitable.

00:19:18.310 --> 00:19:23.650
He is ingenious.

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:24.960
Sit down.

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:29.210
We are not hungry.

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:30.000
But I insist.

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:46.840
Very well, Korobi, what do you want from us?

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:49.840
For now, just that you eat and have fun.

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:53.470
Doctor, try the wine, you will find it excellent.

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:57.470
You will find us uncooperative, unless you explain yourself now.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:20:00.000
Fortunately, I can change this attitude.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:14.000
It seems real.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.300
And they are, I guarantee.

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:19.450
Diamonds, rubies, emeralds, sapphires.

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:23.750
All the crystallized forms that you so desire.

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:26.370
A fortune for each one of you.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.780
If you go away without more questions.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:33.620
We can make a ton of these in our ship for you, Korob.

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:35.640
They mean nothing to us.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:40.490
You don't say. I don't understand, I read that...

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:42.440
Whatever you've read, you've read wrong.

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:44.440
And we'll only leave when we're ready.

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:50.580
You are very... unpredictable.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:56.330
Hmm. Maybe I made a small mistake.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:58.330
However, you passed the tests.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:00.000
Tests?

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:12.730
Yes. Our analysis of you may have something wrong, but you were warned to move away, and yet you came to save your colleagues. This proves loyalty.

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:22.850
Your bravery was tested and you did not retreat. And despite my small mistake with these colored stones, I realize that you cannot be subdued.

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:28.640
In many ways, you are very admirable.

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:59.350
Very well, see you soon then, Sylvia.

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:13.440
Dr. McCoy, Mr. Spock, Captain Kirk, do you want to know what we did to your men?

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:17.940
Really, for us, it is very simple to probe the mind of creatures like you.

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:21.710
Mental probe? Hypnosis?

00:22:21.710 --> 00:22:27.520
You like to think of yourself as complex creatures, but you are mistaken.

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:30.000
Someone can enter your minds

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.730
through various paths.

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:34.800
You have a lot to worry about.

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:40.380
There are unprotected entrances in every human mind.

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:44.470
Telepathy?

00:22:44.470 --> 00:22:47.860
Not entirely, no.

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:53.710
Telepathy does not indicate control, and I guarantee you, I have total control of your friends.

00:22:53.710 --> 00:22:55.120
Captain!

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:59.440
Don't move. Protect them.

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:04.980
Now I want the rest of our equipment and weapons, and I want some answers.

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:09.820
Put that gun down!

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:16.900
Captain, is it so stupid of you to continue with this demonstration?

00:23:16.900 --> 00:23:28.750
In the mythology of your race, this is called "magic sympathy".

00:23:28.750 --> 00:23:30.000
Jackson,

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.930
The crewman who returned the ship.

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:34.310
You thought about what killed him.

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:36.510
I made an image of him.

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:38.510
In the essence of my thoughts.

00:23:38.510 --> 00:23:41.360
The image was Jackson.

00:23:41.360 --> 00:23:45.640
And when I killed the image, I knew it was dead.

00:23:45.640 --> 00:23:50.280
He died.

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:52.280
You can't kill a man with thoughts.

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:56.020
Your communicator.

00:24:00.760 --> 00:24:04.740
And now, signal for the ship.

00:24:04.740 --> 00:24:07.020
No.

00:24:07.020 --> 00:24:08.520
Sylvia, no.

00:24:08.520 --> 00:24:19.430
Keogh Enterprise, respond. Respond.

00:24:26.860 --> 00:24:29.320
Captain, are you all right? Where are you?

00:24:30.250 --> 00:24:33.140
- Are you okay? - Don't worry about us, what's going on?

00:24:33.140 --> 00:24:35.190
- The temperature is rising. - It's still rising.

00:24:35.190 --> 00:24:41.580
- Read, young lady. - It went up 60 degrees in the last 30 seconds.

00:24:41.580 --> 00:25:00.000
- We're on fire. - Dessal, transfer the force to heat dissipation units.

00:25:00.920 --> 00:25:04.740
We didn't do that, Captain. There was no effect. We are cooking here.

00:25:04.740 --> 00:25:09.590
Very well. I'll take care of everything here. I'll hang up.

00:25:09.590 --> 00:25:21.720
Enough. You've won.

00:25:21.720 --> 00:25:25.960
You can relax now, Captain. Your ship is safe.

00:25:25.960 --> 00:25:29.430
The temperature is almost back to normal.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:35.010
- It's falling fast. - Lieutenant, try to contact the captain again.

00:25:35.010 --> 00:25:47.040
- Enterprise to Captain Kirk, answer. - Enterprise to Captain Kirk, report.

00:25:47.040 --> 00:25:51.970
- We lost them again, Mr. Dessau. - Captain, have you seen anything of our science?

00:25:51.970 --> 00:25:57.010
- Now tell us about yours. - It seems that they are singing in different tones.

00:25:57.010 --> 00:26:00.000
I prefer to know more about yours. Did you call it magic? Did you call it science?

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:02.500
and seems not to be related to anything.

00:26:02.500 --> 00:26:05.710
- And how would you call her? - I wouldn't try to name her.

00:26:05.710 --> 00:26:08.000
What do you seem to do with your minds?

00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:09.800
We do it with tools.

00:26:09.800 --> 00:26:11.820
You change matter.

00:26:11.820 --> 00:26:13.840
You move it through telekinesis.

00:26:13.840 --> 00:26:16.450
Yes, we can modify the molecular structure...

00:26:16.450 --> 00:26:17.920
Korobi, you talk too much!

00:26:17.920 --> 00:26:22.530
You used Scott and Sulu as bait to attract us here.

00:26:22.530 --> 00:26:25.000
Did you know we'd come?

00:26:25.000 --> 00:26:26.550
We didn't need to know.

00:26:26.550 --> 00:26:28.600
- They knew. - Enough of that!

00:26:30.160 --> 00:26:31.860
You will tell us what we want to know.

00:26:32.320 --> 00:26:34.580
It's late for threats, let me contact my ship.

00:26:34.580 --> 00:26:37.080
How long do you think you will need for a search group to come down?

00:26:37.080 --> 00:26:38.390
Some time, Captain.

00:26:38.390 --> 00:26:40.840
A lot of time.

00:26:40.840 --> 00:26:59.060
To the search group, Captain Kirk.

00:27:02.240 --> 00:27:05.540
An impenetrable force field around your ship, Captain.

00:27:05.540 --> 00:27:09.750
It will not affect the orbit, but your people are prisoners inside it.

00:27:09.750 --> 00:27:14.430
Some kind of force field, sir.

00:27:14.430 --> 00:27:18.370
But not like any other you've heard of.

00:27:18.370 --> 00:27:22.290
It's not coming from anywhere.

00:27:22.290 --> 00:27:24.320
It seems to be around us.

00:27:24.320 --> 00:27:26.390
I'll let you know to cooperate, Captain.

00:27:26.390 --> 00:27:30.000
Forced extraction of the information we want from you is not complicated.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:35.390
But it is extremely painful and there is still a certain empty effect.

00:27:35.390 --> 00:27:36.390
We have nothing to discuss.

00:27:36.390 --> 00:27:38.280
Take us to the cellar.

00:27:38.280 --> 00:27:57.810
The doctor will stay. You will be the next captain, it makes little difference.

00:27:57.810 --> 00:28:00.000
Take us to the cellar.

00:28:13.850 --> 00:28:16.350
Do not analyze the wavelength measurement, Mr. Chekov.

00:28:16.350 --> 00:28:20.090
You are not analyzing, sir.

00:28:20.090 --> 00:28:27.150
Very well. But it is there. And it is real. And if it is real, it can be affected.

00:28:31.400 --> 00:28:35.080
Engineering, wait to transfer all the force to the external shell.

00:28:35.380 --> 00:28:38.000
Prepare the propulsors to generate the maximum heat as soon as possible.

00:28:38.400 --> 00:28:41.610
Maybe we can't break it.

00:28:42.010 --> 00:28:45.500
But bet on your beans credits that we can crush it.

00:28:50.680 --> 00:28:54.350
- How long has it been? - 22 minutes, 17 seconds.

00:28:54.750 --> 00:29:00.000
- Thank you. - What will they be doing to me?

00:29:00.030 --> 00:29:02.300
I guarantee we'll find out soon.

00:29:02.300 --> 00:29:12.990
Jim, all these things that we are seeing for a terrestrial like you must be familiar.

00:29:12.990 --> 00:29:18.670
Familiar, frightening, irrational.

00:29:18.670 --> 00:29:26.970
Precisely. I remind you of the psychological theory, of the racial subconscious, the universal myths, symbols.

00:29:26.970 --> 00:29:27.980
Ghosts, witches, right?

00:29:27.980 --> 00:29:29.980
And dungeons, and castles, and cats.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:33.920
All this belongs to the dark world of the unconscious.

00:29:33.920 --> 00:29:39.090
They tried to probe our conscious mind and failed.

00:29:39.090 --> 00:29:42.330
They basically reach the subconscious.

00:29:42.330 --> 00:29:47.870
Korobi seemed very intrigued by our reaction to the environment he created.

00:29:47.870 --> 00:29:50.850
He expected me to react as if all this was normal.

00:29:50.850 --> 00:29:55.170
Well, he admitted that they were not natives of this planet.

00:29:55.170 --> 00:30:00.000
And not having knowledge of our scientific methods is very strange.

00:30:00.760 --> 00:30:02.880
There is any form of life in this galaxy.

00:30:02.880 --> 00:30:08.240
They call us creatures, as if we were a species with which we are familiar.

00:30:08.240 --> 00:30:15.750
Well, if we are creatures, how should they be?

00:30:15.750 --> 00:30:21.890
They can only be totally different in all aspects.

00:30:21.890 --> 00:30:24.350
I agree, totally.

00:30:24.350 --> 00:30:30.000
And I don't like strange hostages showing so much interest in our galaxy and our worlds, Mr. Spock.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:32.580
There's nothing to do with friendly visitors.

00:30:32.580 --> 00:30:40.870
We'll have to stop them, coldly, but at the moment...

00:30:40.870 --> 00:30:46.770
I feel lost this time to suggest a way out.

00:31:00.570 --> 00:31:02.400
Ah, macro.

00:31:02.400 --> 00:31:30.000
Did you forget why we were sent here?

00:31:30.060 --> 00:31:32.760
I didn't forget anything. I'm not a doll like you, Korobi.

00:31:32.760 --> 00:31:33.660
You're a traitor.

00:31:33.660 --> 00:31:42.330
And you're a fool.

00:31:42.330 --> 00:31:44.780
We have nothing like that.

00:31:44.780 --> 00:31:46.620
And I like that.

00:31:46.620 --> 00:31:50.770
To touch, to feel the idea of ​​luxury.

00:31:50.770 --> 00:31:56.810
I like it.

00:31:56.810 --> 00:31:58.590
And I don't intend to leave it.

00:31:58.590 --> 00:32:00.000
We have a duty to...

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:04.000
What they know about sensations is that this is a new world.

00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:06.920
You are cruel, you torture our species.

00:32:06.920 --> 00:32:10.840
It's a new sensation, I find it stimulating.

00:32:10.840 --> 00:32:14.080
This is wrong, you are despising all that for what we live.

00:32:14.080 --> 00:32:18.080
I live for my own decisions, you are a fool and weak.

00:32:18.080 --> 00:32:20.080
I have power.

00:32:20.080 --> 00:32:22.630
But are you afraid to use it?

00:32:22.630 --> 00:32:26.860
Do not threaten me, I can crush you.

00:32:26.860 --> 00:32:30.000
This would be an interesting feeling.

00:32:31.240 --> 00:32:33.240
Yes, I think I like these sensations.

00:32:34.080 --> 00:32:36.120
Don't try to force me!

00:32:41.710 --> 00:32:43.380
Captain!

00:32:43.380 --> 00:32:47.590
It's time for our converse.

00:32:47.590 --> 00:32:50.020
Korop, leave us alone.

00:32:50.020 --> 00:32:58.280
And take them with you.

00:32:58.280 --> 00:33:00.000
This is not over yet, Sylvia.

00:33:00.510 --> 00:33:03.350
It can end soon, old man.

00:33:07.540 --> 00:33:15.420
And now, toss your magic wand and destroy my mind too?

00:33:16.320 --> 00:33:18.320
There is no real damage to the mind, Captain.

00:33:19.390 --> 00:33:21.390
Only the drainage of knowledge and will.

00:33:21.390 --> 00:33:22.510
And don't you call that damage?

00:33:23.410 --> 00:33:24.770
Why should I?

00:33:25.760 --> 00:33:30.000
You would have, if you had compassion, a woman.

00:33:30.990 --> 00:33:34.130
You should have compassion, but I forgot that you're not a woman.

00:33:34.130 --> 00:33:37.110
But it's wrong, Captain.

00:33:37.110 --> 00:33:39.290
I'm a woman now.

00:33:39.290 --> 00:33:42.640
I came from a world without sensations,

00:33:42.640 --> 00:33:45.170
like you and I know each other.

00:33:45.170 --> 00:33:48.960
That excites me, and I want more.

00:33:48.960 --> 00:33:51.870
It seems that you need us. Why?

00:33:51.870 --> 00:33:54.300
Because I lack knowledge.

00:33:54.300 --> 00:33:56.660
But with our combined skills,

00:34:00.380 --> 00:34:07.300
Tell me about the power, Captain. What is the feeling?

00:34:07.300 --> 00:34:24.840
Yes, but what about Korob?

00:34:24.840 --> 00:34:29.960
He is a fool. I can without him. But you?

00:34:31.210 --> 00:34:35.170
Why do I think you're different?

00:34:35.170 --> 00:34:37.170
Why is it so hard to get rid of you?

00:34:37.170 --> 00:34:47.990
Why doesn't the sound of my mind find out what you want?

00:34:47.990 --> 00:34:51.760
No, that's not for you.

00:34:51.760 --> 00:34:58.680
What I want is... is to conjugate.

00:34:58.680 --> 00:35:00.000
My mind is yours.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:04.400
Think of the secrets you can learn. Think of the power that can be yours.

00:35:04.400 --> 00:35:06.400
Anything you imagine, I can give you.

00:35:06.400 --> 00:35:19.160
You are very persuasive. What happens if I agree?

00:35:19.160 --> 00:35:23.220
Then it would all be between the two of us.

00:35:23.220 --> 00:35:27.800
I never conceived the idea of ​​dividing before.

00:35:27.800 --> 00:35:29.380
This excites me.

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:31.800
You excite me, why?

00:35:31.800 --> 00:35:33.810
For the same reason you excite me.

00:35:33.810 --> 00:35:46.920
You are a very beautiful woman.

00:35:46.920 --> 00:35:52.820
So you think I'm attractive, but I can be many women.

00:36:03.680 --> 00:36:05.160
Do you like what you see?

00:36:05.160 --> 00:36:11.470
Do you prefer me the way I was?

00:36:11.470 --> 00:36:22.560
You have the gift of giving me difficult choices.

00:36:38.160 --> 00:36:40.160
Is there nothing like this where you come from?

00:36:40.160 --> 00:36:41.080
Nothing.

00:36:41.080 --> 00:36:46.310
And your people, when they come here?

00:36:46.310 --> 00:36:51.290
They are like feathers in the wind without the transmuter.

00:36:51.290 --> 00:36:52.760
Transmuter?

00:36:52.760 --> 00:36:53.910
The source.

00:36:53.910 --> 00:36:58.860
You will learn, I will teach you later, later.

00:36:58.860 --> 00:36:59.830
So...

00:37:00.160 --> 00:37:02.580
It's a device, you use tools.

00:37:02.580 --> 00:37:05.480
It's just the way you're teaching me substance.

00:37:05.480 --> 00:37:08.410
You haven't changed your mind, you're not going back home?

00:37:08.410 --> 00:37:13.280
My house is here with you, billions of worlds of sensations to pick and choose.

00:37:31.280 --> 00:37:33.880
You hug me and I don't drown in your mind!

00:37:33.880 --> 00:37:36.900
You tried to deceive me!

00:37:36.900 --> 00:37:39.700
It's here, like written words!

00:37:39.700 --> 00:37:41.860
You were using me!

00:37:41.860 --> 00:37:45.070
Why not? You were using me and my crew!

00:37:45.070 --> 00:37:55.650
You will be swept away from here!

00:37:55.650 --> 00:37:57.760
You! Your men!

00:37:57.760 --> 00:38:00.000
Your ship! Your...

00:38:00.600 --> 00:38:15.640
I don't see any change.

00:38:15.640 --> 00:38:16.840
There it is, Lieutenant.

00:38:16.840 --> 00:38:20.470
It was the electric field that we did, Mr. Dessal.

00:38:20.470 --> 00:38:22.990
That is more than what I wanted.

00:38:22.990 --> 00:38:26.590
It's not much, but it's just the beginning.

00:38:26.590 --> 00:38:28.270
Continue, Mr. Chekov.

00:38:28.270 --> 00:38:30.000
Turn on all the signals.

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:32.840
of the reactors 1, 2 and 3 in the relay stations.

00:38:32.840 --> 00:38:35.460
Whatever it is, it is weakening.

00:38:35.460 --> 00:38:48.690
I freed the model of your ship from the crystal.

00:38:48.690 --> 00:38:51.450
Although they were to be released soon,

00:38:51.450 --> 00:38:58.900
it is difficult to control so many things in such a short time.

00:39:00.160 --> 00:39:05.420
They must go before she finds out about the missing weapon.

00:39:05.420 --> 00:39:06.880
I'm not going without my men.

00:39:06.880 --> 00:39:10.490
They are no longer your men. They belong to Sylvia.

00:39:10.490 --> 00:39:14.530
I can no longer control them, nor her.

00:39:14.530 --> 00:39:16.860
It is irrational.

00:39:16.860 --> 00:39:20.580
The tension of adopting your form,

00:39:20.580 --> 00:39:24.840
the insatiable desire for sensations and experiences,

00:39:24.840 --> 00:39:26.400
it is a great danger.

00:39:26.400 --> 00:39:28.740
And it was not necessary.

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:33.880
- We could have entered your galaxy in peace. - Did you come in a ship?

00:39:33.880 --> 00:39:37.670
- We used a transmuter. - Transmuter, she mentioned that.

00:39:37.670 --> 00:39:42.780
We don't have time now. She intends to destroy everyone.

00:39:42.780 --> 00:39:56.180
There may still be a chance. Come on, quick!

00:40:20.540 --> 00:40:23.840
- Why is it a cat? - Social memories.

00:40:23.840 --> 00:40:27.560
The cat is the most cruel, the most terrifying of animals.

00:40:27.560 --> 00:40:29.540
From the saber-toothed tiger...

00:40:30.600 --> 00:40:34.480
- I think I can stop her. - Leave it to us.

00:40:34.480 --> 00:40:39.040
Without energy, she must have drained.

00:40:39.040 --> 00:40:42.060
We could have fought Scott and Sula at any time, if we knew.

00:40:42.060 --> 00:40:48.150
- No way out. - This is my problem.

00:40:48.150 --> 00:40:52.790
- She's like me. - Come on, quick.

00:41:21.980 --> 00:41:25.000
- Can you do it? - I'll try when I can, Captain. Get ready.

00:41:44.650 --> 00:41:47.320
- Open the door, he won't stand it. - Go away!

00:42:15.200 --> 00:42:17.790
Korobe thought this was important.

00:42:17.790 --> 00:42:19.740
It was something about the transmuter.

00:42:19.740 --> 00:42:26.460
A little more driving, please.

00:43:00.410 --> 00:43:18.760
Jim!

00:43:31.210 --> 00:43:33.770
We've found them all, Captain.

00:43:33.770 --> 00:43:35.910
And now that we've come together...

00:43:35.910 --> 00:43:50.980
It's a very unpleasant situation, Captain.

00:43:50.980 --> 00:43:54.660
If the phasers had the strength...

00:43:54.660 --> 00:43:58.580
Who knows?

00:44:26.680 --> 00:44:29.600
I have the transmitter. It's mine now.

00:44:38.920 --> 00:44:40.750
You are very smart, Captain.

00:44:40.750 --> 00:44:43.400
More than I imagined.

00:44:43.400 --> 00:44:47.480
Smart, diligent and attractive.

00:44:47.480 --> 00:44:49.330
Do not let her touch the staff, Captain.

00:45:00.830 --> 00:45:04.530
- Don't you ever get tired of these games? - I never play games. Give it to me.

00:45:04.530 --> 00:45:06.530
I wasn't sure before, but now I have.

00:45:06.970 --> 00:45:11.870
- This is the source of your power, isn't it? - No, it's not the source. It's just an amplifier, a directer.

00:45:11.870 --> 00:45:15.870
The mind is the source, mine is simple. Yours is the key, you don't know how to use it.

00:45:15.870 --> 00:45:19.870
- I learn very fast. - It's not too late yet, Captain James Kirk.

00:45:20.350 --> 00:45:24.800
- Come with me, I'll teach you and you'll teach me. - Why? You have nothing of your own, that's why you need us?

00:45:24.850 --> 00:45:29.020
We need your dreams, your ambitions. With them I can build, give me the transmitter.

00:45:29.020 --> 00:45:29.440
No.

00:45:30.510 --> 00:45:33.790
You fool! Don't you know what I'm dealing with?

00:45:33.790 --> 00:45:35.790
Everything your species thinks is desirable.

00:45:35.790 --> 00:45:39.560
Look at me. I'm a woman. I'm all women.

00:45:39.560 --> 00:45:43.030
I don't know what you are, but you're not a woman.

00:45:43.030 --> 00:45:46.680
You tortured my men and took their minds.

00:45:46.680 --> 00:45:49.300
You ask for love and then you give back pain.

00:45:49.300 --> 00:45:52.380
Korob is wrong. I didn't destroy all your weapons.

00:45:52.380 --> 00:45:56.280
Give me the transmuter. Give it to me now!

00:46:15.520 --> 00:46:18.280
- What happened, Jim? - We need some explanations.

00:46:18.280 --> 00:46:19.910
- Is everything gone? - Not everything.

00:46:31.850 --> 00:46:33.750
Korob and Sylvia as they really are.

00:46:33.750 --> 00:46:37.900
The forms were an illusion, just like the castle and everything else.

00:46:37.900 --> 00:46:39.900
Only the device gave them reality.

00:46:39.900 --> 00:46:44.600
Fascinating. A totally strange way of life in our galaxy.

00:46:44.600 --> 00:46:47.030
If we could preserve it, study it...

00:46:47.030 --> 00:46:58.010
Too late. All this... an illusion.

00:46:58.010 --> 00:47:00.000
Not at all.

00:47:01.470 --> 00:47:02.790
Jackson is dead.

00:47:02.790 --> 00:47:05.990
Kirk Enterprise, respond.

00:47:05.990 --> 00:47:08.200
Waiting, Captain.

00:47:08.200 --> 00:47:09.320
Five to go.

00:47:31.050 --> 00:47:31.510
Thank you.
